  "referenceNumber": "SYR0422",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that the Sultan Murad Division is an involved person under the Syria (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: the Sultan Murad Division is or has been involved in repressing the civilian population in Syria. \n",
